        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:0.5rem">Every section on this page is intentionally short. Your website should not need a manual the size of a printer's, and the goal here is for you to find what you need in under a minute and get back to running your business. If anything in here is unclear, tell me and I will fix the page rather than ask you to read around the problem.</p>
